    <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&#10;🟦 Service — stable name + load balancing&#10;⬜ Pod — disposable running container (managed by a Deployment)&#10;🟩 config / credentials / storage — outlive the pods&#10;→ solid: request path · ⇢ dashed: referenced by name&#10;(NN) = file in k8s/" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#546E7A;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="g-ns">
